{"text": "The night had finally arrived. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was the night to take a photo of the Milky Way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Dan had been checking the weather and searching for the perfect location. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As he drove to the spot, he could not stop smiling and his heart raced with anticipation. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> However, when he arrived, dark clouds began to cover the sky. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Within minutes, every star disappeared behind the thick clouds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Dan waited for over an hour, checking his weather app constantly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Even worse, it started to rain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He lowered his head, letting out a loud sigh. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He could do nothing but drive back home, downhearted.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "f", "i", "n", "a", "l", "l", "y", " ", "a", "r", "r", "i", "v", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "a", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "p", "h", "o", "t", "o", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "M", "i", "l", "k", "y", " ", "W", "a", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "D", "a", "n", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "b", "e", "e", "n", " ", "c", "h", "e", "c", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "e", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "e", "a", "r", "c", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "e", "r", "f", "e", "c", "t", " ", "l", "o", "c", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "s", " ", "h", "e", " ", "d", "r", "o", "v", "e", " 